{"4365120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pushy Plushy", "steam_appid": 4365120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The same minigame never plays the same</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you play a minigame a new modifier is selected, So even if you play the same minigame 10 times in a row, it never plays the same way. From over-the-top knockback to giving one player a giant hammer while everyone else runs away in fear. You're guranteed to have a crazy time; and to top things off you'll be able to create your own modifiers by combining any two modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c72e3c1e985e8cf143d28e331bcad41b.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c72e3c1e985e8cf143d28e331bcad41b.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c72e3c1e985e8cf143d28e331bcad41b.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick and constantly changing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minigame starts off quick and ends quick, react quick to each new chaotic minigame, modifier and map to stay on top of everyone else. Every round only lasts 30 seconds at the most so you'll never get bored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/16df251309b819c636e5685d803292ed.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/16df251309b819c636e5685d803292ed.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/16df251309b819c636e5685d803292ed.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage each other</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to make sure you win is by sabotaging your friends across 13 unique minigames. Push them off a ledge, shoot them with a gun or just blow them up, as long as they’re not earning points they’re not winning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/2c5bbcc6d9b12e9b12254ef7b73888a2.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/2c5bbcc6d9b12e9b12254ef7b73888a2.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/2c5bbcc6d9b12e9b12254ef7b73888a2.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect all the plushies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who doesn't like a giant collection of plushies? Every time you play you'll earn buttons that you can trade in for new plushies; can you collect every set? You'll even be able to collect new emotes, hats and modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c3771a55faec4c436f51a3c0a0862acd.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c3771a55faec4c436f51a3c0a0862acd.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c3771a55faec4c436f51a3c0a0862acd.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 quick and chaotic minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >46 modifiers (1035 different possible combinations!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different items to sabotage your friends with</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of plushies to collect with special rewards for completing series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer; great for parties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stupid physics fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/fe2258422049a626160ad00874b68c39.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/fe2258422049a626160ad00874b68c39.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/fe2258422049a626160ad00874b68c39.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The same minigame never plays the same</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you play a minigame a new modifier is selected, So even if you play the same minigame 10 times in a row, it never plays the same way. From over-the-top knockback to giving one player a giant hammer while everyone else runs away in fear. You're guranteed to have a crazy time; and to top things off you'll be able to create your own modifiers by combining any two modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c72e3c1e985e8cf143d28e331bcad41b.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c72e3c1e985e8cf143d28e331bcad41b.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c72e3c1e985e8cf143d28e331bcad41b.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick and constantly changing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minigame starts off quick and ends quick, react quick to each new chaotic minigame, modifier and map to stay on top of everyone else. Every round only lasts 30 seconds at the most so you'll never get bored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/16df251309b819c636e5685d803292ed.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/16df251309b819c636e5685d803292ed.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/16df251309b819c636e5685d803292ed.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage each other</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to make sure you win is by sabotaging your friends across 13 unique minigames. Push them off a ledge, shoot them with a gun or just blow them up, as long as they’re not earning points they’re not winning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/2c5bbcc6d9b12e9b12254ef7b73888a2.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/2c5bbcc6d9b12e9b12254ef7b73888a2.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/2c5bbcc6d9b12e9b12254ef7b73888a2.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect all the plushies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who doesn't like a giant collection of plushies? Every time you play you'll earn buttons that you can trade in for new plushies; can you collect every set? You'll even be able to collect new emotes, hats and modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c3771a55faec4c436f51a3c0a0862acd.poster.avif?t=1774527762\" width=608 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c3771a55faec4c436f51a3c0a0862acd.webm?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365120/extras/c3771a55faec4c436f51a3c0a0862acd.mp4?t=1774527762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 quick and chaotic minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >46 modifiers (1035 different possible combinations!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different items to sabotage your friends with</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap